WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.128
I have two older brothers
who both attended

00:00:03.128 --> 00:00:06.840
military academies, and I think
from a very young age

00:00:06.923 --> 00:00:10.593
I saw a military environment
and thought it was super,

00:00:10.593 --> 00:00:11.928
super cool.

00:00:13.888 --> 00:00:15.348
My name is Nita Qiu

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:19.144
and I'm a current senior in Yale
College, and I'm also a cadet

00:00:19.144 --> 00:00:20.979
in the Air Force
ROTC program here.

00:00:20.979 --> 00:00:23.690
Veteran's Day to me means
a day not only to thank

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:25.942
our service members for
what they've done,

00:00:25.984 --> 00:00:29.446
but also it's a day
to recognize the hardships

00:00:29.446 --> 00:00:33.032
and the sacrifices
that all service members face.

00:00:33.116 --> 00:00:35.243
At Yale,
there have been many times

00:00:35.243 --> 00:00:39.038
where I've needed a mentor
or I needed to ask somebody

00:00:39.038 --> 00:00:40.331
a career question

00:00:40.331 --> 00:00:41.750
and there's always someone who's

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:45.503
gone through that same struggle
or had the same question.

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:47.839
I realized that it's
so inspiring

00:00:47.839 --> 00:00:50.633
to be a part of something
that's bigger than yourself.

